/Title (In this stage, architectural specifications are comprehended and designed. Usually, several technical approaches are put out, and the ultimate choice is made after considering both the technical and financial viability. The system architecture is further divided into modules that each handle a distinct function. Another name for this is High-Level Design \(HLD\).)
/Dest [84 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1280 0 R
/Next 1642 0 R
>>
endobj
1642 0 obj
<<
/Title (At this point, the exchange of data and communication between the internal modules and external systems are well understood and defined. During this phase, integration tests can be created and documented using the information provided.)
/Dest [84 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1280 0 R
/Prev 1641 0 R
>>
endobj
1643 0 obj
<<
